@MilosKozak  Several people are loosing DASH pods and have problems because of the DASH communication bug in 3.1.0.3. This bug has been solved in dev for months.

Please put out either a 3.1.0.4 with the new DASH (from memory 3 commits) code or put our 3.2beta2 so that these people can have working DASH pods.

Thanks.
